---
description: Documentation edits
globs: "**/*.md"
alwaysApply: false
---
- Docs record intent and decisions; link to code for values (flags, model IDs, versions).
- Dated progress notes → `CHANGELOG.md`, not the roadmap or architecture docs.
- New core doc → add to `DOCUMENTATION_INDEX.md`. Markdown hard line breaks (two trailing spaces) are intentional — keep them.
